text = "🍳 How to Play: Little Guy vs. The Kitchen
🎯 Objective
Battle it out in a frantic kitchen showdown! Reduce your opponent's Health Points (HP) from 4 down to 0 before they defeat you. The ultimate winner claims the legendary Big Double Chunk Chocolate Cookie!

🕹️ Controls
Little Guy (Player 1)

Move: Use W, A, S, D keys to move up, left, down, and right.

Attack: Press R to swing your weapon when within 250 pixels of the Marshmallow.

The Marshmallow (Player 2)

Move: Use the Arrow Keys (Up, Down, Left, Right) to move.

Attack: Press L to strike with your knife when within 250 pixels of Little Guy.

⚔️ Combat Rules
Health: Both characters start with 4 HP displayed at the top of the screen.

Attack Range: You must be close to your opponent (within 250 pixels) for your attack (R or L) to successfully land and reduce their health.

Visual Feedback: When you press your attack key, your character will instantly swap to their attack/knife image.

Victory: The moment either player's HP reaches 0, the game automatically transitions to the Win Screen to crown the victor and present their hard-earned cookie reward!"

